ALAB operates an asset-light model with strong pricing power, leveraging its niche semiconductor solutions to command premium margins. The company’s ability to reinvest FCF into R&D creates a self-reinforcing loop of product differentiation and market expansion. However, the high R&D spend could strain margins if demand falters.  

**Compounding Verdict:** Strong fundamentals with execution risk tied to R&D intensity.

